  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      188.85,
      201.55,
      374.85,
      226.89
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE MONERAGALA DISTRICTKANTHA MAHA SANGAMAYA",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      237.55,
      402.01,
      310.89
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS an Association called and known as the\u201cMoneragala District Kantha Maha Sangamaya\u201d hasheretofore been established for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said Association according to the rulesagreed by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      321.55,
      402.06,
      382.89
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsfor which it was established and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      393.55,
      401.95,
      418.89
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      429.55,
      401.82,
      454.89
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Moneragala DistrictKantha Maha Sangamaya (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      465.55,
      402.01,
      598.89
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cMoneragala District Kantha Maha Sangamaya\u201d (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cMaha Sangamaya\u201d) or shall hereafter beadmitted as members of the \u201cMoneragala District KanthaMaha Sangamaya\u201d shall be a body corporate (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetual successionunder the name and style of the \u201cMoneragala District KanthaMaha Sangamaya\u201d and by that name may sue and be sued inall Courts, with full power and authority to have and use acommon seal and alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      609.55,
      402.01,
      634.89
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      645.55,
      401.96,
      671.01
    ],
    "text": "(a)to function as a forum for organizations of womenin the Moneragala District;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      467.06,
      455.81,
      525.73
    ],
    "text": "IncorporationofMoneragalaDistrictKantha MahaSangamaya .",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
