      447.67,
      397.28,
      473.37
    ],
    "text": "(h)to assist poor women to obtain legal aid and legalinstructions where necessary;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      484.63,
      397.33,
      522.57
    ],
    "text": "(i)to grant aid and provide welfare facilities to womensuffering from mental and physical disabilities andto old women;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
