    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      373.87,
      402.04,
      448.77
    ],
    "text": "4.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any writtenlaw, the Corporation shall have the power, including thefollowing powers to do, perform and execute all such acts,matters and things whatsoever as are necessary or desirablefor the promotion or furtherance of the objects of theCorporation or any one of them:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      460.03,
      401.95,
      510.21
    ],
    "text": "(a) to acquire and hold, rent, lease, mortgage, pledge,sell, exchange or engage in other manner orotherwise dispose of any immovable property,required for the purpose of the Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      521.47,
